  "referenceNumber": "RUS0796",
  "remarks": "\nMaksim Borisovich KRASOVSKIY (hereafter KRASOVSKIY) is an editor at InfoRos, an organisation linked to the Government of Russia which spreads disinformation. In his role as an editor at InfoRos, KRASOVSKIY has provided support for and promoted actions and policies which destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
